{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Casino Resort Tower</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casino Resort Tower is about watching people truly live inside a tower you designed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guests don\u2019t just walk through rooms. They react to comfort, delays, cleanliness, crowds, and the overall feel of your resort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those experiences turn into <strong>moodlets</strong> \u2014 small emotional signals that quietly tell the story of what life inside your tower feels like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes that story is smooth and joyful.<br>Sometimes it\u2019s chaos.<br>And every time, it\u2019s yours to shape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/8330d276248e5618e76fe0d6e75a3a40.poster.avif?t=1766565208\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/8330d276248e5618e76fe0d6e75a3a40.webm?t=1766565208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/8330d276248e5618e76fe0d6e75a3a40.mp4?t=1766565208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Tower Tells Stories</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build casinos, hotels, lounges, staff rooms and services as your resort grows upward.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch guests and employees move in real time through elevators, corridors and floors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every item you place changes how people feel about the space they\u2019re in.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A good break room lifts morale.<br>A bad hallway spreads frustration.<br>Your design becomes a chain reaction of lived experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/c30bdf3dc88a8bcde0d2eb4115b15082.poster.avif?t=1766565208\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/c30bdf3dc88a8bcde0d2eb4115b15082.webm?t=1766565208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/c30bdf3dc88a8bcde0d2eb4115b15082.mp4?t=1766565208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/ffdf7db4436468aea2b62896c7aa36d7.poster.avif?t=1766565208\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/ffdf7db4436468aea2b62896c7aa36d7.webm?t=1766565208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/ffdf7db4436468aea2b62896c7aa36d7.mp4?t=1766565208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From Moodlets to Moments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People inside your tower develop moodlets based on what they go through:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long queues, crowded rooms, broken facilities, noisy floors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comfort, cleanliness, decoration, smooth access and smart layouts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don\u2019t just manage numbers.<br>You manage how life feels inside your tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/31d09044d808f91e73d33b0eebfde59f.poster.avif?t=1766565208\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/31d09044d808f91e73d33b0eebfde59f.webm?t=1766565208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/31d09044d808f91e73d33b0eebfde59f.mp4?t=1766565208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/0b9d1e52866f94e3cc5631183d267299.poster.avif?t=1766565208\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/0b9d1e52866f94e3cc5631183d267299.webm?t=1766565208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/0b9d1e52866f94e3cc5631183d267299.mp4?t=1766565208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>When Things Fall Apart</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elevators jam.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Staff get overwhelmed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guests react to the atmosphere you\u2019ve created.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You step in, make adjustments, and watch the mood shift back in real time as your tower heals itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/dec6ddf9a13a85bfdd1abbeb1fc2da34.poster.avif?t=1766565208\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/dec6ddf9a13a85bfdd1abbeb1fc2da34.webm?t=1766565208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/dec6ddf9a13a85bfdd1abbeb1fc2da34.mp4?t=1766565208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/3880ea1bfe484f562280fe9f64414c71.poster.avif?t=1766565208\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/3880ea1bfe484f562280fe9f64414c71.webm?t=1766565208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/3880ea1bfe484f562280fe9f64414c71.mp4?t=1766565208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Living Simulation Under the Surface</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behind every moodlet is a layered simulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your layout shapes movement.<br>Movement shapes waiting times.<br>Waiting times shape emotions.<br>And emotions quietly reshape your entire resort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don\u2019t just optimize systems.<br>You uncover how your casino actually works.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/8e56af964a7530545563961f5c2f3a71.poster.avif?t=1766565208\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/8e56af964a7530545563961f5c2f3a71.webm?t=1766565208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/8e56af964a7530545563961f5c2f3a71.mp4?t=1766565208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/fa873798b53d43272d3147301294a4b4.poster.avif?t=1766565208\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/fa873798b53d43272d3147301294a4b4.webm?t=1766565208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/fa873798b53d43272d3147301294a4b4.mp4?t=1766565208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deep Without Being Punishing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casino Resort Tower is a deep simulation \u2014 but a forgiving one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Small mistakes create ripples, not dead ends.<br>Big failures become the most satisfying rescues.<br>The tower doesn\u2019t collapse \u2014 it adapts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re encouraged to experiment, break things, and bring them back stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/4e22922668d2e20c06ff53f8703650df.poster.avif?t=1766565208\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/4e22922668d2e20c06ff53f8703650df.webm?t=1766565208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/4e22922668d2e20c06ff53f8703650df.mp4?t=1766565208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Built in the Open</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casino Resort Tower is in Early Access and continues to evolve with player feedback.<br>Major updates expand the world, the stories your tower can tell, and the ways your guests experience life inside it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":" Master of Mixology","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1457030/84143ea572016029ca4ee757cdbb487f2f15fa56.jpg"},{"name":"Latte Legend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1457030/813a50dc397d14ebfe70b43ce4572344f39c26ba.jpg"},{"name":"Chilled to Perfection","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1457030/2eb516425f569e4577e896f71a09e60e2ed752d0.jpg"},{"name":"Hotshot Brewer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1457030/85eba3625d3628afac5f3a5e7a6f8699aad5351b.jpg"},{"name":"Mini-Bar Magnate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1457030/8b594c388b397a9cc59dedb47c991800f7a85a17.jpg"},{"name":"Kitchen Conqueror","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1457030/dbee0fc07e863f814fe5e03ef3108923a415fa33.jpg"},{"name":"All-Nighter Empire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1457030/efaa96378f3bdf788b24259bf8734b43623a696c.jpg"},{"name":"Snack Overlord","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1457030/58064ec06f584f593eb2425ff42276c17b73eafc.jpg"},{"name":"Cloud Commander","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1457030/8da40f6f6424a7781473b10011288e2164dc1c3d.jpg"},{"name":"Vendor Virtuoso","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1457030/c4312b11257b0997e23d80edb0c7a5397e18e2c6.jpg"}],"total":74},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1457030?t=1766565208","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/688cc0306f8db251bc23fddb89ef15ae51ba9e79/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766565208","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/8f26f2b2acfef74cf2fb932830fa26eb1ffd98ed/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766565208","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/8f26f2b2acfef74cf2fb932830fa26eb1ffd98ed/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766565208","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>THE ROADMAP</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/3f19d4c316e2cbfc0437788b76141941.avif?t=1766565208\" width=780 height=2386 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Casino Resort Tower</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casino Resort Tower is about watching people truly live inside a tower you designed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guests don\u2019t just walk through rooms. They react to comfort, delays, cleanliness, crowds, and the overall feel of your resort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those experiences turn into <strong>moodlets</strong> \u2014 small emotional signals that quietly tell the story of what life inside your tower feels like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes that story is smooth and joyful.<br>Sometimes it\u2019s chaos.<br>And every time, it\u2019s yours to shape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/8330d276248e5618e76fe0d6e75a3a40.poster.avif?t=1766565208\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/8330d276248e5618e76fe0d6e75a3a40.webm?t=1766565208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/8330d276248e5618e76fe0d6e75a3a40.mp4?t=1766565208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Tower Tells Stories</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build casinos, hotels, lounges, staff rooms and services as your resort grows upward.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch guests and employees move in real time through elevators, corridors and floors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every item you place changes how people feel about the space they\u2019re in.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A good break room lifts morale.<br>A bad hallway spreads frustration.<br>Your design becomes a chain reaction of lived experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/c30bdf3dc88a8bcde0d2eb4115b15082.poster.avif?t=1766565208\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/c30bdf3dc88a8bcde0d2eb4115b15082.webm?t=1766565208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/c30bdf3dc88a8bcde0d2eb4115b15082.mp4?t=1766565208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/ffdf7db4436468aea2b62896c7aa36d7.poster.avif?t=1766565208\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/ffdf7db4436468aea2b62896c7aa36d7.webm?t=1766565208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/ffdf7db4436468aea2b62896c7aa36d7.mp4?t=1766565208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From Moodlets to Moments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People inside your tower develop moodlets based on what they go through:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long queues, crowded rooms, broken facilities, noisy floors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comfort, cleanliness, decoration, smooth access and smart layouts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don\u2019t just manage numbers.<br>You manage how life feels inside your tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/31d09044d808f91e73d33b0eebfde59f.poster.avif?t=1766565208\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/31d09044d808f91e73d33b0eebfde59f.webm?t=1766565208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/31d09044d808f91e73d33b0eebfde59f.mp4?t=1766565208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/0b9d1e52866f94e3cc5631183d267299.poster.avif?t=1766565208\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/0b9d1e52866f94e3cc5631183d267299.webm?t=1766565208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/0b9d1e52866f94e3cc5631183d267299.mp4?t=1766565208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>When Things Fall Apart</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elevators jam.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Staff get overwhelmed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guests react to the atmosphere you\u2019ve created.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You step in, make adjustments, and watch the mood shift back in real time as your tower heals itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/dec6ddf9a13a85bfdd1abbeb1fc2da34.poster.avif?t=1766565208\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/dec6ddf9a13a85bfdd1abbeb1fc2da34.webm?t=1766565208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/dec6ddf9a13a85bfdd1abbeb1fc2da34.mp4?t=1766565208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/3880ea1bfe484f562280fe9f64414c71.poster.avif?t=1766565208\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/3880ea1bfe484f562280fe9f64414c71.webm?t=1766565208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/3880ea1bfe484f562280fe9f64414c71.mp4?t=1766565208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Living Simulation Under the Surface</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behind every moodlet is a layered simulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your layout shapes movement.<br>Movement shapes waiting times.<br>Waiting times shape emotions.<br>And emotions quietly reshape your entire resort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don\u2019t just optimize systems.<br>You uncover how your casino actually works.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/8e56af964a7530545563961f5c2f3a71.poster.avif?t=1766565208\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/8e56af964a7530545563961f5c2f3a71.webm?t=1766565208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/8e56af964a7530545563961f5c2f3a71.mp4?t=1766565208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/fa873798b53d43272d3147301294a4b4.poster.avif?t=1766565208\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/fa873798b53d43272d3147301294a4b4.webm?t=1766565208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/fa873798b53d43272d3147301294a4b4.mp4?t=1766565208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deep Without Being Punishing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casino Resort Tower is a deep simulation \u2014 but a forgiving one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Small mistakes create ripples, not dead ends.<br>Big failures become the most satisfying rescues.<br>The tower doesn\u2019t collapse \u2014 it adapts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re encouraged to experiment, break things, and bring them back stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/4e22922668d2e20c06ff53f8703650df.poster.avif?t=1766565208\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/4e22922668d2e20c06ff53f8703650df.webm?t=1766565208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/extras/4e22922668d2e20c06ff53f8703650df.mp4?t=1766565208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Built in the Open</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casino Resort Tower is in Early Access and continues to evolve with player feedback.<br>Major updates expand the world, the stories your tower can tell, and the ways your guests experience life inside it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Cyperk Software"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1457030/b2e2968294785efa0acaa125763e0078efba7d3a/header.jpg?t=1766565208","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright\u00a9 2026 Cyperk Software | All rights reserved","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OSX 10.13<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 2 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 4600 (AMD or NVIDIA equiv